  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "聲韻學",
    "sub_ename": "HISTORICAL CHINESE PHONOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程首先介紹漢語音韻學的基礎知識和標音符號；繼而從語音歷史流變的角度探討漢語古今音韻的演化；終而引領學生透過客觀的漢語音韻學知識，賞析古典文學的音韻之美，進而解決日常生活中字音的音讀問題，學以致用。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course first introduces the basic knowledge and transcription of Chinese phonology; then discusses the evolution of Chinese phonology from the perspective of the historical evolution of phonology; finally leads students to appreciate the beauty of classical literature through objective knowledge of Chinese phonology, and then Solve the problem of pronunciation and pronunciation in daily life, and apply what you have learned.\r\n",
